1. Button Group
<div class="btn-group">
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Apple</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Samsung</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Sony</button>
</div>
.btn-group → buttonlarni bitta guruhga birlashtiradi.
2. Group Size

Hamma buttonlarni birdan kattalashtirish/kichraytirish:
<div class="btn-group btn-group-lg">
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Apple</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Samsung</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Sony</button>
</div>
3. Vertical Button Group

Buttonlar tepada-pastga joylashadi:
<div class="btn-group-vertical">
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Apple</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Samsung</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Sony</button>
</div>
4. Justified Button Group

Buttonlar butun kenglikni teng bo‘lib oladi:
<div class="btn-group btn-group-justified">
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Apple</a>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Samsung</a>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Sony</a>
</div>
.btn-group-justified → guruhni to‘liq kenglikka yoyadi.
5. Dropdown bilan Group

Button ichida qo‘shimcha menyu ochish:
<div class="btn-group">

    <button class="btn btn-primary">Apple</button>

    <button class="btn btn-primary">Samsung</button>

    <div class="btn-group">

        <button class="btn btn-primary dropdown-toggle"
                data-toggle="dropdown">
            Sony <span class="caret"></span>
        </button>

        <ul class="dropdown-menu">
            <li><a href="#">Tablet</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Smartphone</a></li>
        </ul>

    </div>

</div>
6. Split Button Dropdown

Buttonning o‘zi va dropdown tugmasi alohida:
<div class="btn-group">

    <button class="btn btn-primary">
        Sony
    </button>

    <button class="btn btn-primary dropdown-toggle"
            data-toggle="dropdown">
        <span class="caret"></span>
    </button>

    <ul class="dropdown-menu">
        <li><a href="#">Tablet</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Smartphone</a></li>
    </ul>

</div>
<div class="">
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Apple</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Samsung</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary">Sony</button>
</div>
.btn-group              → buttonlarni guruhlaydi
.btn-group-lg           → katta
.btn-group-sm           → kichik
.btn-group-xs           → juda kichik
.btn-group-vertical     → tepaga-pastga
.btn-group-justified    → to‘liq kenglik
.dropdown-toggle        → dropdown ochadi
data-toggle="dropdown"  → dropdownni ishlatadi
